{%- comment -%}
  Inline social icons for the footer. All paths normalised to a
  24×24 viewBox so they render consistently inside the round
  icon button (set via .footer__social).

  Params:
    name - one of linkedin, twitter, instagram, facebook, youtube,
           tiktok, medium, github
{%- endcomment -%}

